        "reconcileSharedFileAddAcceptance",
        "sharedCreateDispatch"
      ],
      "scope": "One failed original add, one separate acceptance identity, frozen File/owner/frontier, three ordered immutable Records (review/adopted/completion), one attempt per Record, and a cold read of five full shared proof classes. Unknown immutable fact may be exactly observed without inventing an ACK, allowing only the next distinct Record.",
